## Repair this note authorizes the code to make

`citations_for` will bind each citation by path, commit, expected hash, and authored note, and will consume that read so a later citation cannot borrow it. The same path and commit are not enough. A failed expectation stays on its own object and in the unknowns with its expected hash.

The default text and the derived candidate will print the handoff kind `recorded-prime-intent`, the author, and each evidence commit with the statement. Each lane will show source kind, commit, and path, plus the source-bound review disposition and explicit terminal state. Accepted with terminal null stays the open lifecycle the brief already computes. A null worker stays `unrecorded`. `elected` stays null. Unidentified and unprojected rows will name their source path. Projection time, custody `captured_at`, and live-file `live_observed_at` will have separate labels. A historical blob gets no invented live timestamp. The text will say that decisions absent from the record are unexamined and that an empty conflicts list is not a global clearance.

The record schema, pins, bounds, stale-hash refusal, and no-write protections stay. The new view is written under `evidence/deskstate05.20` from the original `desk.json`. The old rehearsal is not overwritten.

